      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Milford Mine Memorial Park in Crosby preserves the memory of the town’s mining past, with benches and information boards detailing the 1914 disaster.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cuyunacabins.com/post/the-history-of-crosby-mn-from-mining-tragedy-to-outdoor-adventure",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today, Crosby balances its mining heritage with outdoor recreation, ranking among Minnesota’s top destinations for mountain biking and lake activities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cuyunacabins.com/post/the-history-of-crosby-mn-from-mining-tragedy-to-outdoor-adventure",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Cuyuna Lakes region around Crosby owes much of its landscape to the former iron ore mines, turning old pits into scenic lakes.",
